  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 4301.02 Applicability. This chapter shall apply to all existing OSWI units, as defined in Env-A 4302.02, and their owners and operators.\n\nSource. #8787, eff 1-5-07; ss by #10765, eff 1-22-15; ss by #14248, eff 5-20-25, EXPIRES: 5-20-35",
